        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S50004, Single Cylinder Disc Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Disc Deadbolt is Emtek's most modern looking deadbolt lock. It's sleek appearance is enhanced by the stain stainless steel appearance. The Stainless Steel Disc Single Cylinder Deadbolt is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Disc Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
